    ('Daniel Okafor', 'd.okafor@example.com', '+1 555 0190', 'I think I left a black umbrella at table 4 on Saturday evening. If you found it, I can pick it up this week.', 'ARCHIVED', 'en', now() - interval '9 days' + interval '2 hours', now() - interval '9 days', now() - interval '9 days'),
